              </tr>
            
              <tr class="hover:bg-blue-50/50 transition">
                <td class="py-3 px-4 font-bold text-slate-900">Surfboard</td><td class="py-3 px-4 ">定制内核</td><td class="py-3 px-4 ">良好 (Surge 语法规则)</td><td class="py-3 px-4 ">低 (约 50MB)</td><td class="py-3 px-4 ">良好</td><td class="py-3 px-4 ">仿 iOS 风格</td><td class="py-3 px-4 ">★★★☆☆</td>
              </tr>
            
          </tbody>
        </table>
