              </p>
            </div>
          
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="font-bold text-amber-900 bg-amber-200/80 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs flex-shrink-0">新购安卓旗舰机</span>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 leading-relaxed">
